      "body": "@voegtlel The requested changes are now validated on the refreshed head and the addressed inline threads are resolved. The corrected existing checkpoint test explicitly enables virtual epochs in its zero-worker same-loader path, which fails on unchanged source and passes with the fix. The original packed two-worker fresh-loader case remains. This reproduces the issue with repository fixtures; it does not claim a production training incident. Focused real runtime tests and full repository Ruff pass. Could you approve any waiting workflows and re-review this head?",
